THIRD-PARTY 3D MODELS

This license covers the source code only. It does NOT cover the 3D models in
public/models/, which are the work of their original authors and institutions
and remain under their own licenses (CC0 1.0 or CC BY 4.0).

The source, author and license of every model are listed in assets/pieces.json
and shown on each piece's label inside the museum. The models were simplified
and compressed for the web.

Anyone reusing a CC BY 4.0 model must credit its original author, link to the
license and indicate that changes were made, as that license requires. These
attributions must be kept in any copy or derivative of this project.
